The {{nihongo|'''Yokoyama clan'''|横山氏|Yokoyama-shi}} is a family of [[Nakami Region|Nakami]]an [[wikipedia:daimyo|daimyo]] who were to become an important political force in the unification of Nakami in the mid-16th century.